Subject: [PATCH 1/3] smb/server: support notify pending and cancel

It works correctly with smbclient, the following samba patch is required
to add cancel support:

  https://lore.kernel.org/linux-cifs/20260608142815.388768-2-chenxiaosong@chenxiaosong.com/

Example:

  smbclient //192.168.53.210/test -U root%1
  smb: \> notify /
  # Press `Ctrl+C`
  notify cancelled

But there are still some issues when testing on Windows 11.
Windows11 File Explorer test steps:

  - 1. Enter top share directory
  - 2. Enter subdirectory `dir`
  - 3. Enter top share directory again

The log when the issue occurs is shown below.
